# BRK-29
heading(F, "BRK-29", "### BRK-29 TASE trades Monday to Friday: its trading guidelines set session times for Monday to Thursday and for Friday")
setf(F, "BRK-29", "Rule", "- Rule: TASE's trading guidelines (chapter א', \"מועדי המסחר\", s.1) set every session phase for days ב' to ה' (Monday to Thursday) and for day ו' (Friday): for shares, the pre-close phase \"יחל בימים ב' עד ה' בשעה שיקבע הדירקטוריון ואשר תהיה בין השעה 15:00 לשעה 18:10 ובימי ו' ... בין השעה 12:00 לשעה 13:35\"; bonds, makam and derivatives follow the same two schedules. No session times are set for Sunday. TASE's periodic report dates the move to this week to 5.1.2026 (\"המעבר למתכונת המסחר החדשה יושם בפועל ביום 5.1.2026\"), after the ISA approved the rule amendment on 30.7.2025.")
setf(F, "BRK-29", "Conditions", "- Conditions / exceptions: The guidelines page with the timetable is marked \"מעודכן עד ליום 4.1.26\" (update 141), consistent with that date. The exact hours are set by the TASE board within the ranges the guidelines give. Order types and phase mechanics are in the same guidelines (chapter ה'), not summarised here. 2026-10-26 (scope settling): settled from the guidelines; before, the record rested only on TASE's periodic report.")
setf(F, "BRK-29", "Source", "- Source: [מדריך המסחר בבורסה: הנחיות על פי החלק השלישי לתקנון (TASE)](https://content.tase.co.il/media/mwsduioc/274698.pdf), file p.4, ch. א' s.1(א)(4)-(6), (ב), (ג) (\"יחל בימים ב' עד ה' בשעה שיקבע הדירקטוריון\") · checked 2026-10-26 · primary (exchange rules, ISA-approved); [TASE periodic report 2025, 1.7.5.3, 1.7.5.4](https://content.tase.co.il/media/kvjpsnmx/tase_ltd_periodic_report_for_2025.pdf?guid=b4232a8e-909e-473e-84c6-3ece08e3158a), p.25 · checked 2026-10-25 · institution (TASE's own report, for the date)")
